    "raw_yaml": "# 口径卡：同机 loopback、1KB、单提供者，开环 10000 req/s——回答\"给定负载下的延迟分布（含尾延迟）\"。\n# 开环按计划发出时刻计时（修正 coordinated omission），见 docs/benchmarking.md。\n# 改动口径请复制成新 id（-v2），不要原地改。\nprofile: loopback-latency-v1\nquestion: 同机 loopback、1KB、单提供者，开环 10000 req/s 下的延迟分布\ntarget:\n  transport: rpc\n  service: BenchService#echo\n  payload: { kind: bytes, size: 1024 }\n  serializer: protobuf\n  providers: 1\nload:\n  model: open\n  rate: 10000\n  duration: 60s\n  warmup: 20s\n  steady_window: [20s, 55s]\n  rounds: 3\n  timeout: 1s\nisolation:\n  client_process: separate_jvm\n  server_process: separate_jvm\n  same_host: true\n  registry: docker-compose/zookeeper\nmeasure:\n  histogram: { significant_digits: 3, max: 10s }\n  report: [throughput, p50, p95, p99, p999, max, errors_by_status]\nassert:\n  errors_max: 0\n"
